BEGIN:VEVENT
X-SOURCE:Meetup: The Mindful Stream
UID:event_316790605@meetup.com
SEQUENCE:1
DTSTAMP:20261017T041206Z
DTSTART;TZID=America/New_York:20261020T213000
DTEND;TZID=America/New_York:20261020T223000
SUMMARY:Awakening Awareness: Embracing This Moment
DESCRIPTION:The Mindful Stream\nFeel free to join as we get still and prac
 tise presence within this moment. We will discuss and observe the obstacle
 s that\, seemingly\, block us from being present and bring awareness to ou
 r unconsciousness in a safe\, inclusive and affirming way.\n\nSessions are
  suitable for newcomers\, those experienced in Tolle's teaching and anyone
  wishing to remain completely anonymous.\n\nSee you there!\n\nPlease be aw
 are that sessions will close if no members have joined after 10 minutes.\n
 \nEmrys has been passionate about mindfulness since 2010 and since 2021 he
  has been organising free\, weekly online meditation groups. For more info
 rmation on his free Work of Byron Katie online mediation group\, visit [th
 is Meetup Group link](https://www.meetup.com/thework-runsfree/).
URL;VALUE=URI:https://www.meetup.com/themindfulstream/events/316790605/
STATUS:CONFIRMED
CREATED:20261001T020548Z
LAST-MODIFIED:20261001T020548Z
CLASS:PUBLIC
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
X-SOURCE:Meetup: The Mindful Stream
UID:event_316797700@meetup.com
SEQUENCE:1
DTSTAMP:20261017T041206Z
DTSTART;TZID=America/New_York:20261021T110000
DTEND;TZID=America/New_York:20261021T111500
SUMMARY:Simple Sitting Meditation (15 minutes)
DESCRIPTION:The Mindful Stream\nIn these sessions\, I will be doing guided
  meditations where we simply sit and notice what arises.\n\nThere is no ag
 enda and no plan for how these sessions unfold. I might start off simply b
 y asking us to notice what is already present. By becoming aware of what
 ’s going on in our heads and in our body.\n\nThen\, the meditation may t
 ake on a life of its own.\n\nOur job is to simply be present to what arise
 s. We may notice the mind moving and chattering about. Or we may notice th
 at it’s completely silent.\n\nThe goal here\, if there is one\, is to si
 mply let ourselves be as we are.
URL;VALUE=URI:https://www.meetup.com/themindfulstream/events/316797700/
STATUS:CONFIRMED
CREATED:20261001T151800Z
LAST-MODIFIED:20261001T151800Z
CLASS:PUBLIC
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
X-SOURCE:Meetup: The Mindful Stream
UID:event_316807501@meetup.com
SEQUENCE:1
DTSTAMP:20261017T041206Z
DTSTART;TZID=America/New_York:20261021T213000
DTEND;TZID=America/New_York:20261021T223000
SUMMARY:Beginners in The Work of Byron Katie: Newcomers Welcome
DESCRIPTION:The Mindful Stream\nA free Zoom meditation session designed wi
 th newcomers in mind. Sessions will include at least one hour of facilitat
 ion (meditation) and there is room for questions and answers throughout. I
 f you're curious about The Work\, you're invited to join!\n\nTo best prepa
 re for each session\, complete a *Judge Your Neighbour* worksheet free at 
 [https://thework.com/part-three/](https://thework.com/part-three/) or visi
 t [http://www.thework.com](http://www.thework.com)\n\nSee you there!\n\nPl
 ease be aware that sessions will close if no members have joined after 10 
 minutes. *If you notice any errors with this - or any - event\, please do 
 not hesitate to contact Emrys directly on Meetup or at mindfulnesswithemry
 s@gmail.com.*\n\n**To book a free introductory private session with Emrys\
 , [click here](https://calendly.com/mindfulnesswithemrys/onehoursession)[.
 ](https://mindfulnesswithemrys.business.site/)**\n\nEmrys also organises a
  free Work of Byron Katie Meetup group. Visit: [https://www.meetup.com/the
 work-runsfree](https://www.meetup.com/thework-runsfree/)
URL;VALUE=URI:https://www.meetup.com/themindfulstream/events/316807501/
STATUS:CONFIRMED
CREATED:20261002T015221Z
LAST-MODIFIED:20261002T015221Z
CLASS:PUBLIC
END:VEVENT
